⭐ 1. Common Functions in All Number Wrapper Classes
(Applies to: Byte, Short, Integer, Long, Float, Double)
Static Methods
✔ valueOf(String s)
Converts String to wrapper object.
✔ parseInt(), parseDouble(), etc.
Convert String to primitive.
✔ toString()
Convert value to String.

Instance Methods
✔ intValue(), doubleValue(), floatValue()
Convert wrapper object to primitive types.
✔ compareTo()
Compare two wrapper objects.
✔ equals()
Check equality.

⭐ 2. Integer Class (Most Used)
Important Methods
parseInt(String s)
valueOf(int i)
toString(int i)
compare(int a, int b)
compareTo(Integer another)
intValue()
byteValue()
MIN_VALUE, MAX_VALUE (constants)
sum(), max(), min()

⭐ 3. Double Class
Methods
parseDouble(String s)
valueOf(double d)
isNaN()
isInfinite()
doubleValue()

⭐ 4. Float Class
Methods
parseFloat()
valueOf()
isNaN()
isInfinite()
floatValue()

⭐ 5. Long Class
Methods
parseLong()
valueOf()
toString()
compare()
bitCount(long value) – counts number of 1-bits
rotateLeft(), rotateRight()

⭐ 6. Short Class
Methods
parseShort()
valueOf()
shortValue()
compare()

⭐ 7. Byte Class
Methods
parseByte()
valueOf()
byteValue()

⭐ 8. Boolean Class
Methods
parseBoolean(String s)
valueOf(boolean b)
booleanValue()
toString(boolean b)
compare(boolean x, boolean y)

⭐ 9. Character Class
(This is one of the most detailed wrapper classes.)
Character testing methods
isDigit(char c)
isLetter(char c)
isLetterOrDigit(char c)
isUpperCase(char c)
isLowerCase(char c)
isWhitespace(char c)

Character conversion methods
toUpperCase(char c)
toLowerCase(char c)
toString(char c)

Other useful
charValue()
compare(char x, char y)